        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Celebrity Apprentice 3, The Apprentice 9, Celebrity Apprentice\n- People: Bret Michaels\n- Organizations: Poison, Billboard Hot 100\n- Topics: reality game shows, music chart achievements\n\nFacts:\n- The Celebrity Apprentice 3, also known as The Apprentice 9, is the ninth installment of the reality game show Celebrity Apprentice.\n- Bret Michael Sychak was born on March 15, 1963, and is professionally known as Bret Michaels.\n- Bret Michaels is an American singer-songwriter and musician.\n- Poison has charted ten singles in the Top 40 of the Billboard Hot 100, including six Top 10 singles.\n- Poison earned a number-one Billboard Hot 100 single with \"Every Rose Has Its Thorn\".\n- The two-hour season finale of The Celebrity Apprentice 3 aired on Sunday, May 23, 2010, from 9 to 11 p.m. ET/PT.\n- Bret Michaels, the lead singer of Poison and a star of Rock of Love, won The Celebrity Apprentice 3.",
